  "description": "CommonUtilities is a modular, production-ready C#/.NET utility library and toolkit designed to accelerate development for .NET 8+ projects. It contains a broad set of helpers, models, and utilities for common application needs (security, data, HTTP, scheduling, media, cloud integrations, and more). The codebase is organized for easy consumption as a project reference or compiled library.",
